s command completion/output and actual exceptions, not transaction result elements. The README at lines 59-62 and frozen description explicitly disclaim aggregate EXEC classification and older QUEUED-completion coverage. The frozen head adds regressions for successful Throwable-valued results and real member failures. The overview supplies no additional concrete defect; cross-version integration behavior was not claimed to be independently verified in this pass.","commit":null,"disposition":"not_warranted","key":"review:5609794746"},{"analysis":"This overview identifies the same open nullability issue as inline:4350007722 and explicitly lists the transaction capability issue as resolved. Candidate commit 1 removes the two test-helper annotations and unused import. Its general cross-version caution contains no separate actionable finding; live Redis/version-matrix integration tests were not run in this Docker-in-Docker-disabled environment.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"review:5616374009"},{"analysis":"Removed both @Nullable parameter annotations from transactionSpan and the unused javax.annotation.Nullable import, as required by docs/contributing/style-guide.md:169 and .github/instructions/java-style.instructions.md. Null arguments and all transaction assertions are unchanged. Applied the scoped existing formatter, compiled the shared testing module, passed its Checkstyle task, and passed all nine selected classification unit tests.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"inline:4350007722"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"8a42a991b98cb73a3eb3ca5fc8daed62f14998d1c0b37f5d0f31b96cfd4d9942","schema":2},"download_sha256":"7ab4ac99be3911ac54f5ec4b439eac62fa6d6696b813039ed8fb2a07efd7af97","frozen_sha":"ba76dd7fea266c5888de6ac1d6a816de42a241dd","pr":20793,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"8a42a991b98cb73a3eb3ca5fc8daed62f14998d1c0b37f5d0f31b96cfd4d9942","request_id"